OL,3,GNEWSANomadic life for Irish Travellers
OL,4,A'at risk' due to accommodation site
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe nomadic life of Irish Travellers is
OL,8,F"at risk" in Northern Ireland with
OL,9,Fmembers of the community feeling
OL,10,Fpressured to move into "bricks and
OL,11,Fmortar" housing, a support group has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe number of sites and pitches in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland has "reduced
OL,16,Fdrastically" in the past 20 years,
OL,17,Faccording to the Craigavon Travellers
OL,18,FSupport Committee.
OL,20,FIt added that the issue was
OL,21,F"compounded" by "well below par"
OL,22,Fprovisions on remaining sites.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
