OL,3,GNEWSANomadic life for Irish Travellers
OL,4,A'at risk' due to accommodation site
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Northern Ireland Housing Executive
OL,8,F(NIHE), which is responsible for the
OL,9,Faccommodation needs of travellers, said
OL,10,Fit is investing in and future-proofing
OL,11,Ftheir way of life.
